	*  RNs On Call: phone answering service and late night nurse triage service; $2500/yr for 1 provider. Plan to change to $250/month service when more than 16 nurse triage calls received per month. Plan to charge all patients, except parents of infants less than 60 days of age, $12./ call. This must be stated up front in insurance company contracts. Plan to also include this information in the “Introduction to practice” brochure.";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}}s:10:"persistent";a:4:{s:4:"date";a:2:{s:7:"created";i:1227357437;s:8:"modified";i:1243256857;}s:7:"creator";s:9:"Rik Faith";s:11:"last_change";a:7:{s:4:"date";i:1243256857;s:2:"ip";s:12:"76.3.208.126";s:4:"type";s:1:"E";s:2:"id";s:11:"staff:start";s:4:"user";s:12:"clepperfaith";s:3:"sum";s:0:"";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";}s:11:"contributor";a:1:{s:12:"clepperfaith";s:28:"Melissa R. Clepper-Faith, MD";}}}